title start
kind: note
tags: business-plan conventions prompt-page-template
Conventions prompt page template
title end

paragraph start
A prompt page stores one prompt for one task. The prompt text goes in a code block so it is kept exactly. Around it, the page states the task, the input the AI needs, the output expected, and what a person checks before using it.
paragraph end

paragraph start
One prompt per page. Variants of a prompt are named in the page name and never stacked in one file.
paragraph end

code start
language: text
Task: what the AI must produce
Input: what it receives
Rules: what it must follow, including the folder rules
Output: the exact form of the answer
Stop: where it must stop and wait
code end

